  "runtimeAssertions": [
    "Learned counts and scores are recomputed from current owned revisions, not trusted model output.",
    "One contribution per insight and occasion; current cooked feedback supersedes weak behavior even when neutral.",
    "Full current note and exact supporting excerpt/revision remain available; no silent rating-only fallback.",
    "Generation does not create RecipeHistory or cooking evidence.",
